  "summary": "partsupp, supplier, nation and region in canonical row order: uniform 65536-row groups, frame-of-reference coded numeric/integer columns, text as offsets + bytes; key flags: partsupp rows sorted by ps_partkey and supplier rows by s_suppkey (kind 1).",
